    id: String.raw`i-n5BfXBm`,
    title: String.raw`10 O’Clock Staging `,
    alt: String.raw`Two cowboys and their horses wait in sunlit tall grass for a stagecoach, one kneeling with a rifle, the other watching from horseback, in a painterly color photograph of the American West by Wayne Heim.`,
    description: String.raw`Painterly Western fine art photograph—this color portrait of two men and their horses captures the tension and beauty of a stagecoach wait at the edge of wild country. Every detail—sunlit grass, weathered hats, blue saddle blanket—draws out the cinematic richness and emotional weight of the moment. Wayne Heim’s process fuses historical realism with a luminous, painterly palette, transporting viewers into the heart of the American West. Essential for collectors of cowboy art, painterly fine art photography, and authentic Americana.
© Wayne Heim`,
    story: String.raw`Morning sun climbs, bathing every color in anticipation and purpose. Sweat beads, dust shimmers, saddle leather glows with stories untold. The clock strikes ten—she’s late. Nerves on edge, they hold their places. Distant rumbles echo—steel, hooves, danger on the ridge.
“Steady, Billy. Stick to the plan.”
Today, patience is the hardest virtue. Vengeance or fortune—both ride with the morning wind.`,
    notes: String.raw`This color rendering builds on the visual traditions of Hudson River School landscapes and classic Western illustration, while introducing a cinematic intensity that only painterly color can achieve. The blue of the saddle blanket and the sun-warmed tones of earth and leather evoke nostalgia, grounding the narrative in both history and myth. The composition pulls the eye toward the horizon, echoing the quiet suspense of frontier storytelling. Instead of drama through action, this work invites the viewer to linger in a moment of anticipation—where every detail is charged with the possibility of what’s about to unfold.`,
    src: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-n5BfXBm/1/LbFJFVzKJGtw2GfK7C9sBHMZntvkPKDF4KbHVPt9k/XL/_WHO0807-1138-1139-XL.jpg`,
    srcXL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-n5BfXBm/1/LbFJFVzKJGtw2GfK7C9sBHMZntvkPKDF4KbHVPt9k/XL/_WHO0807-1138-1139-XL.jpg`,
