    keywords: ["western fine art photography","painterly storytelling","moral ambiguity","facing history","Wayne Heim","Able Reckoning","instant of consequence","western conflict art","narrative fine art photography","rembrandt light western","wyeth realism","contemporary western art","frontier justice","brother against brother","historical reenactment photography","fine art western print","painterly western imagery"],
