    id: String.raw`i-k4b6c5b`,
    title: String.raw`What Remains`,
    alt: String.raw`Elderly cowboy wearing a wide-brim hat, painterly Western fine art portrait with soft dust tones.`,
    description: String.raw`A painterly Western fine art portrait shaped by memory, endurance, and restraint. Framed in softened light and dust-washed tones, the figure carries the weight of years without spectacle or apology. Wayne Heim’s cinematic approach favors quiet presence over narrative explanation, allowing age, expression, and atmosphere to suggest a life measured not by regret, but by what was survived and kept. © Wayne Heim`,
    story: String.raw`Time doesn’t announce itself.  
It just settles in.

The years collect quietly—behind the eyes, in the set of the jaw, in the spaces where words used to live. Some things were carried. Others were left behind on purpose.

The hat still fits. The past does too, though not the way it once did. What mattered stayed. What didn’t fell away, one mile at a time.

This isn’t sorrow.  
It’s accounting.

What remains is enough.`,
    notes: String.raw`This work distills the Western figure down to essence rather than myth. Heim resists nostalgia in favor of lived presence, allowing time itself to become the subject. The restrained palette and softened edges echo the erosion of years, while the gaze holds steady—neither longing nor remorseful. For collectors drawn to Western narratives of endurance, survival, and quiet reckoning, *What Remains* stands as a meditation on the dignity of having lived.`,
    src: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-k4b6c5b/1/MKtpHTnfrz4Djdr5DQJpMPzbkZvCHTfzjzSScSvDw/XL/Old%20West%20Cowboy%20Portrait%20_HF29248-Edit-Edit-2-XL.jpg`,
    srcXL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-k4b6c5b/1/MKtpHTnfrz4Djdr5DQJpMPzbkZvCHTfzjzSScSvDw/XL/Old%20West%20Cowboy%20Portrait%20_HF29248-Edit-Edit-2-XL.jpg`,
    srcL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-k4b6c5b/1/KVWcjhpkcjb29d7twrHzvmr6SdzMmf36XkfD4K7zm/L/Old%20West%20Cowboy%20Portrait%20_HF29248-Edit-Edit-2-L.jpg`,
