    srcS: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-MvZxkQh/0/NhGBdrNCb5NSXJfXTjTj8pwsVdDgNDNjWqHxdkxj4/S/_HF24859-Edit-2-Edit-S.jpg`,
