    id: String.raw`i-Rx5gLJz`,
    title: String.raw`Smoke and Consequence`,
    alt: String.raw`Gritty Western portrait of a stern cowboy with a cigar, wearing a long coat and hat; painterly fine art photography with cinematic mood.`,
    description: String.raw`A weathered sheriff stands at dawn, half in smoke, half in memory. His vest catches the morning light while the air thickens with tension—one word away from gunfire. This painterly Western fine art photograph captures the quiet before violence, the moment when pride and consequence share the same breath. Created by award-winning fine art photographer Wayne Heim, this image blends cinematic storytelling with the timeless grit of the American frontier. © Wayne Heim | Western Fine Art | Painterly Photography | Historical Narrative`,
    story: String.raw`Running their mouths like a mountain stream in spring.
Night after night with these two… nothing but trouble.

Martha always told me to “use my words first.”
But I reckon they gotta be deaf or dumb.

Now the sun’s rising on a day that’s bound to go sideways.
Whiskey, words, and lead are never a good combination.`,
    notes: String.raw`This portrait holds tension in every detail. The subject’s stance is relaxed, but his gaze isn’t. That look—quiet, calculating—delivers more narrative than any action could.

Heim’s painterly technique channels the tonal control of Frank Tenney Johnson and the narrative weight of Howard Terpning, rendering not just a figure, but a moment suspended between patience and consequence.

The lighting isolates the subject without dramatization, allowing texture, expression, and posture to do the storytelling. This is Western art at its most distilled: a single character, a single breath, and everything unsaid.`,
    src: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/Pennsylvania/Old-Bedford-Historical-Village/OBV-Wild-West-Weekend-2024/i-Rx5gLJz/8/NgczwHq3gtPBSfmF9V3Tcfb6TTHcmqBCDwRQwLMRz/XL/cowboy%20artwork%20_HF20502-Enhanced-NR-Edit-2-XL.jpg`,
    srcXL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/Pennsylvania/Old-Bedford-Historical-Village/OBV-Wild-West-Weekend-2024/i-Rx5gLJz/8/NgczwHq3gtPBSfmF9V3Tcfb6TTHcmqBCDwRQwLMRz/XL/cowboy%20artwork%20_HF20502-Enhanced-NR-Edit-2-XL.jpg`,
