    id: String.raw`i-sTnckb6`,
    title: String.raw`Making Their Stand`,
    alt: String.raw`Three cowboys—afoot and mounted—fire their guns while shrouded in thick morning fog. Painterly fine art Western photography by Wayne Heim.`,
    description: String.raw`Painterly fine art Western photography by Wayne Heim. Two cowboys—one charging on foot, one mounted—make their stand in the swirling fog. This dramatic, cinematic moment captures the untamed spirit and tension of Old West legends, rendered in a painterly style for collectors and Western art enthusiasts. Discover more cowboy stories, Western art prints, and limited editions at K4 Studios. © Wayne Heim`,
    story: String.raw`Together we stand. Together we fall. Brothers in arms. Who would’ve thought yesterday would carve this path— smoke, grit, and riotous intent. 

But she’s not making excuses. No apologies for what was, or what’s about to be. Destiny clings to our boots and backs, heavy as the fog, thick as the silence before the first shot.`,
    notes: String.raw`“Making Their Stand” pulls the viewer into a Western myth where clarity and chaos collide. The drifting fog both reveals and conceals—the figures emerging like half-remembered legends. Notice how the dynamic lines and opposing postures balance the composition: one grounded and urgent, the other poised in motion.

There’s a visceral tension here, reminiscent of Russell’s kinetic scenes and the atmospheric suspense found in classic Western cinema. Heim’s painterly process intensifies the sense of unreality, blurring the line between history and legend.

For collectors: this is Western art with a pulse—alive with narrative energy, inviting you to step into the fray.`,
    src: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-sTnckb6/1/K3QL4x83Thxx5zVsDrnFHhr5LqXCjFGRRk3vqfDHm/XL/_O1H1983-Enhanced-NR-Edit-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg`,
    srcXL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-sTnckb6/1/K3QL4x83Thxx5zVsDrnFHhr5LqXCjFGRRk3vqfDHm/XL/_O1H1983-Enhanced-NR-Edit-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg`,
    srcL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-sTnckb6/1/KDwhz4CjbSp7gk8xSL4Bd88bccVpS7k9T7n6jzCSf/L/_O1H1983-Enhanced-NR-Edit-Edit-Edit-L.jpg`,
