    srcS: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-7dCKHjg/0/NSNRDC2c4LKPCxsC9nb9krX2csNGqd2Fb4TPS6rzx/S/_WHO0921-Edit-S.jpg`,
