    id: String.raw`i-7GcQw6R`,
    title: String.raw`Exploring Rugged Spirit`,
    alt: String.raw`New fine art photograph © Wayne Heim`,
    description: String.raw`Explore rugged spirit with Wayne Heim's powerful works of art. This western landscapes fine art piece conveys outlaw portraits, cowboy art, and rugged spirit, perfect for fans of powerful works of art. © Wayne Heim`,
    story: String.raw`This image embodies frederic remington and painterly cowboy portraits, captured by Wayne Heim in his signature style. It reflects western landscapes fine art with a touch of wild west photography. © Wayne Heim`,
