    id: String.raw`i-P8B2zJj`,
    title: String.raw`Armed and Alarmed`,
    alt: String.raw`Frontier woman, rifle ready, painterly fine art by Wayne Heim`,
    description: String.raw`Painterly Wild West themed photography of a frontier woman startled by something outside. Embrace the spirit of the Old West with Wayne Heim’s captivating cowboy art and western photographs. Each piece of his fine art photography, infused with a unique painterly photography style, captures the raw emotion and timeless beauty of the frontier. Bring the essence of the Wild West into your space with stunning western art that immortalizes the cowboy spirit. © Wayne Heim`,
    story: String.raw`[Interior. Early frontier home. A woman’s silhouette—frozen, rifle raised, eyes locked on the door.]
The hush after the storm, thick with the taste of something wrong.  
She stands alone, listening for footsteps—her grip steady, her heart uncertain.  
Is it just the wind, or something come calling?  
No time for fear. Not tonight.`,
    notes: String.raw`Echoing the bold narrative style of Remington and the psychological depth of Wyeth, this piece distills frontier suspense into a single, painterly composition. Note the interplay of shadow and lamplight sculpting her resolve—every brush of detail on her face and hands anchoring the viewer in her world. This is more than a portrait; it’s a study in Western resilience and ambiguity, rendered in Wayne Heim’s signature cinematic style. Museum-quality storytelling for collectors seeking fine art with both mythic and human weight.`,
    src: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-P8B2zJj/0/NMPzjrcKJpTDpzwvqC8Hbs4KjXp7kKXJJ5mL8pzkt/XL/_O1H0181-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg`,
    srcXL: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/Western-Cowboy-Portraits/Color/i-P8B2zJj/0/NMPzjrcKJpTDpzwvqC8Hbs4KjXp7kKXJJ5mL8pzkt/XL/_O1H0181-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg`,
