    id: String.raw`i-Mm3jXFH`,
    title: String.raw`Waiting on News`,
    alt: String.raw`Cowboy Art: Waiting on News`,
    description: String.raw`Painterly Wild West themed photography of woman in hat waiting for good news. Embrace the spirit of the Old West with Wayne Heim’s captivating cowboy art and western photographs. Each piece of his fine art photography, infused with a unique painterly photography style, captures the raw emotion and timeless beauty of the frontier. Bring the essence of the Wild West into your space with stunning western art that immortalizes the cowboy spirit. © Wayne Heim`,
    story: String.raw`Painterly Wild West themed photography of woman in hat waiting for good news. Embrace the spirit of the Old West with Wayne Heim’s captivating cowboy art and western photographs. Each piece of his fine art photography, infused with a unique painterly photography style, captures the raw emotion and timeless beauty of the frontier. Bring the essence of the Wild West into your space with stunning western art that immortalizes the cowboy spirit. © Wayne Heim`,
    notes: String.raw`This portrait draws its strength from stillness rather than action. The subject is framed in pause, allowing posture and gaze to carry the narrative weight.

Her stance suggests endurance more than anticipation—waiting as a condition of frontier life, not a momentary delay. The absence of overt drama keeps the image grounded in lived experience rather than romantic myth.

Within Western portraiture, this restraint sets the work apart. The story is implied through presence alone, placing the viewer in quiet conversation with time, labor, and unresolved hope.`,
