    srcS: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/West-Virginia/Hardwood/Hardwood-25/i-z3wvMkB/0/KLB9bdSgK3MZsPL99zQjQs5qhLVqQjRBRg3FVz4mT/S/_HF23239-Edit-S.jpg`,
