    srcS: String.raw`https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-JM7kNVv/0/MBBC49MkB79tn8fbCzvD5p5wLHKJb7cWpmRGvCWFB/S/_HF28460-1140-S.jpg`,
