    id: String.raw`i-GPq6m5q`,
    title: String.raw`Waiting for news from camp`,
    alt: String.raw`Two cowboys on horseback at night, one looking upward and the other scanning the distance, dressed in rugged Western gear—fine art painterly photograph by Wayne Heim.`,
    description: String.raw`Sheltered by the little bit of shade they could find on this desolate hillside, two women wait for their cowboys to return. They said they wouldn't be long but it's been hours.`,
